The {{Term/Store|Phantom Set||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Piggyback 402"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Phantom Equipment||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="BotW Adventure Log"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}. 

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Phantom Equipment was added in {{TMT}} [[Downloadable Content]] pack. It is [[Armor Set]] composed of the [[Phantom Helmet]], [[Phantom Armor]], and [[Phantom Greaves]]. They're available through the [[Side Quest]] "[[EX Treasure: Phantasma]]", which can be obtained by reading [[Misko's EX Journal]] at the [[Outpost Ruins]].<ref name="BotW Misko's EX Journal"/> They can be found at the following locations:
* The [[Coliseum Ruins]]
* The [[Sacred Ground Ruins]]
* The [[Hyrule Garrison Ruins]]

Wearing the Phantom Equipment does not provide a [[Set Bonus]], though wearing the full set will "scare" people Link encounters. Each individual piece will increase [[Link]]'s attack power. After each piece is obtained, [[Granté]] will begin to sell them in [[Tarrey Town]]. They cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] nor can they be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]]. Their design is based on [[Phantom Zelda]] from {{ST}}.

